Menu Vimb-File, Label "File", Left
"New Window" Action Exec "vimb" exec vimb
"New Private Window" Action Exec "vimb" exec vimb -i
"New Tab" Action SendMessage ":t" N+Return
"Open Location..." Action SendMessage ":o "
"Close Tab" Action SendMessage ":q" N+Return
"" NonSelect
"Quit" ActionSendMessage C-Q
END

Menu Vimb-Navigate, Label "Navigate", Left
"Back" Action SendMessage C-O
"Forward" Action SendMessage C-I
"Stop" Action SendMessage C-C
"Reload" Action SendMessage N+R
"Super Reload" Action SendMessage S+R
"Home" Action SendMessage M-Down
END

MenuBar Vimb
Vimb-File
Default-Edit
Vimb-Navigate
END

Style
"vimb" NoSBarH, NoSBarV
"vimb" MiniIcon vimb.xpm, MenuBar Vimb
END
